    <title>
      Warped compactifications
      and massive spin-2 spectra
    </title>
    <summary>
      We study higher-dimensional gravity solutions with warped compact
      dimensions and compute the associated Kaluza-Klein spectrum of
      massive spin-2 fluctuations.
    </summary>
